{"t": "API para desenvolvedores", "b": "<h1 id=\"api-para-desenvolvedores\">API para desenvolvedores<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#api-para-desenvolvedores\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h1>\n<p>O OmniGuard expõe um serviço tipado no <code>ServicesManager</code> do Bukkit, além de eventos do Bukkit. Um plugin de exemplo completo e que\ncompila está em <a href=\"https://github.com/plisquante/OmniGuard/tree/main/examples/api-example\"><code>examples/api-example</code></a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"configuracao\">Configuração<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#configuracao\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Adicione o jar do OmniGuard ao classpath de compilação (scope <code>provided</code> / <code>compileOnly</code>) e declare a dependência:</p>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\"># plugin.yml</span>\n<span class=\"nt\">depend</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p p-Indicator\">[</span><span class=\"nv\">OmniGuard</span><span class=\"p p-Indicator\">]</span><span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\"># or softdepend</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardService</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bukkit</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getServicesManager</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">load</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardService</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">class</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// OmniGuard not installed</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<div class=\"callout warn\">\n<p>Use apenas classes de <code>dev.omniguard.api</code> e <code>dev.omniguard.api.event</code>. Todo o resto é interno e pode mudar.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"omniguardservice\">OmniGuardService<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#omniguardservice\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Método</th>\n<th>Descrição</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>version()</code></td>\n<td>Versão do plugin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isAttackMode()</code> / <code>setAttackMode(\"auto\"\\|\"on\"\\|\"off\")</code></td>\n<td>Modo de ataque</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isMonitorMode()</code></td>\n<td>Modo só de detecção</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isLockdown()</code> / <code>setLockdown(boolean)</code></td>\n<td>Bloqueio total</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stats()</code></td>\n<td><code>StatsSnapshot(packets, blocked, kicks, refusedConnections, dupes, packetsPerSecond, blockedPerSecond, trackedItems)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>checks()</code></td>\n<td>Mapa de ID do check → ativado</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getViolationLevel(uuid, checkId)</code> / <code>getViolations(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Níveis de violação atuais</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exempt(uuid, checkId, Duration)</code></td>\n<td>Isenção temporária de um check, ou <code>\"*\"</code> para todos</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>clearExemptions(uuid)</code> / <code>isExempt(uuid, checkId)</code></td>\n<td>Gerencia isenções</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reportViolation(player, source, detail, amount)</code></td>\n<td>Envia suas próprias detecções para os alertas, Discord, logs do OmniGuard e para as punições do check <code>external</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getLinkedAccounts(name)</code></td>\n<td>Contas que compartilharam um IP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getItemIdentity(item)</code></td>\n<td>Identidade de um item no ledger</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>trackItem(item)</code></td>\n<td>Dá agora uma identidade a um item (por ex. recompensas de caixas); chame na thread dona do item</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getCustody(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Cadeia de custódia (<code>CustodyStep(timeMillis, holder)</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isCompromised(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Se foi confirmado que a identidade foi duplicada</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>Todos os métodos são thread-safe, exceto <code>trackItem</code>. IDs de check desconhecidos lançam <code>IllegalArgumentException</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"exemplos\">Exemplos<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#exemplos\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"isentar-um-jogador-durante-sua-plataforma-de-lancamento\">Isentar um jogador durante sua plataforma de lançamento<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#isentar-um-jogador-durante-sua-plataforma-de-lancamento\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">exempt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getUniqueId</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"invalid-movement\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Duration</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">ofSeconds</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">setVelocity</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Vector</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h3 id=\"reportar-sua-propria-deteccao\">Reportar sua própria detecção<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#reportar-sua-propria-deteccao\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">reportViolation</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"MyAntiCheat\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"reach 6.2 blocks\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h3 id=\"rastrear-recompensas-de-caixas\">Rastrear recompensas de caixas<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#rastrear-recompensas-de-caixas\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">ItemStack</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ItemStack</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Material</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">NETHERITE_SWORD</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"n\">UUID</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">trackItem</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getInventory</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">addItem</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"eventos\">Eventos<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#eventos\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Evento</th>\n<th>Cancelável</th>\n<th>Quando</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardViolationEvent</code></td>\n<td>sim (suprime alerta e punição)</td>\n<td>Todo check que falha</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardPunishEvent</code></td>\n<td>sim (você mesmo cuida da punição)</td>\n<td>Logo antes de um kick ou dos comandos de punição</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardDupeEvent</code></td>\n<td>sim (sem confisco, sem alerta)</td>\n<td>Um duplicado é confirmado</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardAttackModeEvent</code></td>\n<td>não</td>\n<td>O modo de ataque começa ou termina</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"callout warn\">\n<p>Os eventos de violação e punição podem ser <strong>assíncronos</strong> porque os checks de pacotes rodam em threads do Netty. Use o scheduler antes de mexer no mundo. Cancelar nunca deixa o pacote malicioso passar.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nd\">@EventHandler</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">onPunish</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardPunishEvent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getCheckId</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">equals</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"packet-rate\"</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">setCancelled</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\">                         </span><span class=\"c1\">// no kick from OmniGuard…</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">jail</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getPlayerId</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getDetail</span><span class=\"p\">());</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// …your own handling</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"auxiliar-estatico\">Auxiliar estático<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#auxiliar-estatico\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<p><code>OmniGuardAPI</code> (estático) continua existindo para leituras rápidas: <code>isAttackMode()</code>, <code>getViolationLevel(...)</code>,\n<code>getBlockedCount(...)</code>, <code>getItemIdentity(...)</code> e <code>service()</code>, que retorna o <code>OmniGuardService</code> completo.</p>", "c": "<a href=\"#configuracao\">Configuração</a><a href=\"#omniguardservice\">OmniGuardService</a><a href=\"#exemplos\">Exemplos</a><a href=\"#eventos\">Eventos</a><a href=\"#auxiliar-estatico\">Auxiliar estático</a>"}